  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "A generous freehold site of 1012sqm (more or less), tucked into one of Torbay's tightly held pockets, offers genuine scope to renovate, rebuild or hold for the future.\r\nLocation\r\nWalking distance (STA) to Torbay Village's cafes, shops and amenities, with well-regarded schools close by. Long Bay Regional Park, its beach and coastal walkways are just a short stroll away.\r\nThe Home\r\nSet across two elevated levels, the existing 230sqm home takes in views toward Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf.\r\nUpstairs: Open-plan living, dining and kitchen, plus three bedrooms and a bathroom that all enjoying the water outlook.\r\nDownstairs: A self-contained space with its own separate entrance, own sink, bathroom and living area which flexible enough to configure as one bedroom or two, ideal for extended family or Home Office.\r\nKey Features\r\n* Freehold 1012sqm (more or less) in a tightly held location\r\n* Walking distance to Torbay Village, schools and Long Bay Regional Park\r\n* Sea views toward Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf\r\n* Self-contained lower level with separate entrance - flexible as 1 or 2 bedrooms\r\n* Scope to renovate, or explore rebuild/development options, subject to Council approval\r\n* Strong long-term appeal in a sought-after North Shore pocket\r\nBuyers are encouraged to complete their own due diligence on renovation, consents and compliance. Contact us today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nConjunctional are welcome\r\nProperty documents are available here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/I71C",
